CORE
main.cpp
--cpp17 --unwind 3
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] .* one derived element: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] .* mixed: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] .* WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR$
--
g++ 13 (-fsanitize=address,undefined) and clang++ 18 accept this program,
and it fails only its WRONG assertion.  Passes on W100 (before the
regression), fails on W102-W111.
